%% Logistics OS - Timed late-inbound exception cascade (mirrors exception-flow.md)
%% Rendering: Mermaid sequenceDiagram
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant WX as Weather feed (L1)
  participant VIS as Visibility (L3)
  participant INT as Intelligence (L4)
  participant TE as Trigger Evaluator (L5)
  participant CC as Cascade Orchestrator
  participant CA as Context Assembler
  participant PO as Policy Engine
  participant AE as Action Executor
  participant ES as Escalation Mgr
  participant WMS as WMS (labor)
  participant TMS as TMS (carrier)
  participant NOT as Notify (customer)

  WX->>VIS: severe weather on inbound lane
  VIS->>INT: milestone: inbound at risk
  INT->>TE: intel.prediction.v1 (ETA +95m, conf 0.86)
  Note over TE: T+00:05 trigger eval
  TE->>CC: orch.trigger.v1 (LATE_INBOUND, HIGH)
  CC->>CA: assemble decision context
  CA-->>CC: context (facts, signals, options)
  Note over CC: T+00:15
  CC->>PO: evaluate policy (autonomy)
  PO-->>CC: labor=AUTO(L1), carrier=AWAITING_HUMAN(L2), notify=AUTO(L0)
  par automated branch
    CC->>AE: ReallocateLabor
    AE->>WMS: orch.command.v1
    WMS-->>AE: wms.task.events.v1 (ok)
  and notification branch
    CC->>AE: NotifyCustomer (proactive ETA)
    AE->>NOT: orch.command.v1
  and human branch
    CC->>ES: carrier rebook human task (SLA 15m)
    ES->>ES: orch.escalation.v1 if no ack
  end
  Note over CC: T+02:00 auto branches done
  ES-->>CC: human approved re-tender (T+12:00)
  CC->>AE: RebookCarrier
  AE->>TMS: orch.command.v1 (re-tender)
  TMS-->>CC: tms.tender.events.v1 (accepted)
  CC->>CC: VERIFYING -> RESOLVED
  CC->>NOT: final confirmation
  Note over CC: T+18:30 case CLOSED
